 ## Priority lanes
 
-- **P0 / primary release gate:** MC-012, MC-013, MC-017, MC-018, MC-026, MC-031, MC-032, MC-038, MC-039, MC-068, MC-074, MC-079, MC-084, MC-097, MC-104, MC-105, MC-106, MC-107, MC-112, MC-113, MC-114, MC-115, MC-116, MC-118, MC-119, MC-120, MC-122, MC-123, MC-124, and MC-125. These are the current release blockers and must pass deterministic contracts plus Windows/Linux Release packaging before publication.
